cterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character and protagonist of the game and the character the player controls. Being somewhat insensitive and cold plus having been voted to be his school's 'Chairman of Conduct', Haruki has been mis-nicknamed 'The Devil Chairman' although in truth he's actually kinda thoughtful but lazy. He once knew Maho as a child, he forgot about her when she moved away, thus enraging Maho when the two meet again at a park near Haruki's school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c993"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c994","characterName":"吉岡 真穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c994"},"originalCharacterName":"吉岡 真穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend of the main character and the adopted little sister of Michiru Hiragi, Maho is the main heroine of the story. When she was little she developed a strong crush on Haruki and continued having one on him even when she moved away for medical reasons. Making a bet with Michiru, Maho confronts Haruki with hopes he would remember her only to become enraged when she finds out he had completely forgotten all about her. Having lost the bet with Michiru, Maho is forced to attend a semester at Haruki's school as Mao Hiragi, a male student but Haruki's room mate as well. She decides to use her newfound position to get revenge on Haruki, but realizes she still loves him too much."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c994"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/212b372d5ee293dafec23526251eaf38867258e3b586dad4d27fdcf631cba03d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48fc4fd28c3d77abf570e0875422c26a95f9aff3c53610e3ec0976558c4ddc1f.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c995","characterName":"柊 真生","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c995"},"originalCharacterName":"柊 真生","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having lost a bet with her older sister, Michiru, Maho Yoshikawa was forced to attend a school semester as a guy, and thus Mao Hiiragi was born. A very frail and girlish boy by appearance, Mao is actually very stubborn and manipulative. At first he(she) is hostile and critical toward Haruki, Mao eventually becomes a close friend of Haruki's and helps him out on several occasions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a real person and guy (not just an alias of Maho) only in the Japanese versions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maho's younger brother. He is often quiet and seems fragile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His heart has been bad since birth, so he doesn't go to school and stays home most of the time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since he has no school records, Maho is able to use his name to enroll in school after she lost a bet with her older sister, Michiru."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is capturable, and has his own route and H scene."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His character is written out of the English version \"Day Of Love.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c995"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d400f14f12540d7a1e8565eab14e84744740a37537033e450dc514e59e17bad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d4455dddf49973486d514b83282a47ce58a6f63c2f295ff5658611f3a4b88a4.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c996","characterName":"穴山 勇美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c996"},"originalCharacterName":"穴山 勇美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young and talented actor at the main character's school, she is the sister of Seiji. Although the head of the school's drama club and a talented actress, she is serious, proud, and generally unsociable. She loves acting and is always trying to improve, but lately she feels she's in a stunt and partial blames it on her fellow club members. She has a crush on the Haruki and often looks to Haruki for help and support with her acting."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c996"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41473eb04ef000353ee25b07fd6f83ce8884b20d48c143ee953270a566826ecc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6ce90211849d3602dbd93e178ef888042b93f839f0f24bb9aae15d5f7691f8e1.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日 アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日 アン","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:539","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c997","characterName":"穴山 誠二","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c997"},"originalCharacterName":"穴山 誠二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identity